# Two-player Graffiti for the split-screen clip (skate clip two-player-graffiti): 20 s, both players
# tagging the park's ledges and gaps, a steal, the results. Off Big 3 together: player 2 kickflips it
# and tags BIG 3 GAP; player 1 grinds the ledge beside the run-up (tagged) while player 2 rides the
# wave line to WAVE AIR (tagged); player 1 steals BIG 3 GAP back with a Kickflip FS 180 while player 2
# grinds the ledge on the west runway (tagged); player 1 then 50-50s the south rear runway's coping.
park soma
spawn big3
bot balance
p2 bot balance
cmd 0 player2 join big3
cmd 0 setData run.twoPlayer.graffiti.seconds 20
cmd 0 run graffiti2p
hold up 0..100
hold ollie 166..196
p2 hold up 0..100
p2 hold ollie 166..196
p2 tap flip+left 202
# player 1: the ledge by the Big 3 run-up
cmd 450 teleport big3
hold up 450..546
hold right 510..550
hold ollie 550..562
tap grind 572
# player 2: the wave line
cmd 450 player2 teleport wave_west_to_east
p2 bot line wave_west_to_east 456
p2 hold ollie 584..604
# player 1: Big 3 again, Kickflip FS 180
cmd 1100 teleport big3
hold up 1100..1200
hold ollie 1266..1296
tap flip+left 1302
hold spinL 1310..1350
# player 2: the west runway ledge
cmd 1100 player2 teleport big3_runway
p2 hold up 1100..1216
p2 hold ollie 1220..1232
p2 tap grind 1242
# player 1: the south rear runway's coping
cmd 1750 teleport south_rear_runway_to_hellride
cmd 1750 speed 4.5
hold ollie 1754..1764
tap grind 1790
run 3100
expect event graffitiOver count == 1
expect no event bail
